title Vinyl browser, 480x320 (draft Browser-480x320): the Phoenix folder, the playing track, the mini player
sizes 480x320
ppmm 608
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE browser

wait 1200
shot browser
expect esc
expect text "MUSIC / PHOENIX"
expect notext "A-Z"
expect text "Fences Remixes"
expect text "Lisztomania"
expect text "04:04"
key down
wait 300
shot browser-down
expect noquit
